<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Holophane downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Holophane downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has cut its rating for Holophane Corp to outperform from buy, a source at the brokerage said Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Columbus, Ohio, lighting systems company closed Thursday at 20-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
